// Records the suite's slime coat demo (demos/probe-dsb.dm3): Julie on zoo, where the
// player starts at (-2352 1568 0) looking down +x, seen from a camera in front of her,
// before, while and after she is coated in the anti-Sucknblaugh juice (the effects flag
// a juice pond or the AntiSBJuice item sets, EF_ANTISBJUICE). The client game module
// draws her with "antisuckshader" and RF_CUSTOMSHADERPASS: retail draws her skin and the
// slime over it (fakk2.exe 0x4872d0), where the slime alone left only a faint outline of
// her. The "demo-slime" check plays it at 4 frames a second; made on retail by
// refresh-retail.ps1. record needs g_syncronousClients (fakk2.exe 0x4201f6).
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
spawn Camera targetname "camjulie" origin "-2250 1568 56" angles "10 180 0"
stuffcmd "set g_syncronousClients 1"
wait 1
stuffcmd "record probe-dsb"
wait 0.5
cuecamera $camjulie
// 1.5: Julie as she is
wait 2
// 3.5: coated
$player effects +antisbjuice
wait 4
// 7.5: clean again
$player effects -antisbjuice
wait 1.5
stuffcmd "stoprecord"
wait 0.2
stuffcmd "quit"
end
